{"unit_id":"marshfolx__dsh-subagent-setting#card-zh","repo":"marshfolx/dsh-subagent-setting","commit":"5d34984c8c0c4fdb3370501167f5758af5d65bf3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-setting 是面向 DSH Web 设置页的插件，可为新建 subagent 选择默认 provider、model 和 reasoning effort。它在子 agent 创建时记录配置，并改写该子 agent 的模型调用路由，父会话保持原有模型。设置页提供实时模型目录选项、启用开关和保存控件，也可选择让已创建的子 agent 跟随后续配置。插件按模型能力处理 reasoning effort；路由留空时沿用父会话。适合需要为不同子任务指定模型的用户，不需单独配置 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:36-45","lib/index.js:169-200","client/client.js:280-290","client/client.js:453-480"]}
{"unit_id":"marshfolx__dsh-subagent-setting#card-en","repo":"marshfolx/dsh-subagent-setting","commit":"5d34984c8c0c4fdb3370501167f5758af5d65bf3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subagent-setting lets users choose a provider, model and reasoning effort for child agents in DSH Web. It changes subagent calls while leaving the parent unchanged. The page reads the live model catalog and can update existing children. Empty route fields inherit the parent.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:114-136","lib/index.js:169-200","client/client.js:280-290","client/client.js:433-480"]}
