{"unit_id":"marshfolx__dsh-subagent-setting#feature-1","repo":"marshfolx/dsh-subagent-setting","commit":"5d34984c8c0c4fdb3370501167f5758af5d65bf3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-setting 的功能「子 agent 模型路由」：为子 agent 请求覆盖 provider 和 model，不改变父会话。用户在 Web 设置页选择路由，新建子 agent 会使用该模型；留空则继承父会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:169-184","client/client.js:327-357"]}
{"unit_id":"marshfolx__dsh-subagent-setting#feature-2","repo":"marshfolx/dsh-subagent-setting","commit":"5d34984c8c0c4fdb3370501167f5758af5d65bf3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-setting 的功能「思考等级选择」：在模型目录中选择 reasoning effort，并在子 agent 调用前按模型能力校验。若模型不支持该等级，插件会移除该字段；更换路由但未指定等级时也会清除继承的等级。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:114-136","lib/index.js:150-167","client/client.js:359-375"]}
{"unit_id":"marshfolx__dsh-subagent-setting#feature-3","repo":"marshfolx/dsh-subagent-setting","commit":"5d34984c8c0c4fdb3370501167f5758af5d65bf3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-setting 的功能「更新已有子 agent」：开启跟随设置后，修改配置会更新插件跟踪的子 agent 路由，应用到它们之后的请求；关闭时配置只在子 agent 创建时快照。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:175-184","lib/index.js:195-200","client/client.js:378-389"]}
{"unit_id":"marshfolx__dsh-subagent-setting#feature-4","repo":"marshfolx/dsh-subagent-setting","commit":"5d34984c8c0c4fdb3370501167f5758af5d65bf3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-setting 的功能「实时模型目录选择」：设置页读取 DSH 会话模型目录，并将 provider、model 与可用 reasoning effort 展示为选择项；目录失效信号到来时会重新读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:428-444","client/client.js:462-469","client/client.js:327-375"]}
{"unit_id":"marshfolx__dsh-subagent-setting#feature-5","repo":"marshfolx/dsh-subagent-setting","commit":"5d34984c8c0c4fdb3370501167f5758af5d65bf3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-setting 的功能「保存子 agent 设置」：在设置页修改启用状态、provider、model、思考等级及是否更新已有子 agent，按保存后通过配置表单写入；重置可丢弃未保存的修改。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:280-298","client/client.js:378-408"]}
{"unit_id":"marshfolx__dsh-subagent-setting#caveat-1","repo":"marshfolx/dsh-subagent-setting","commit":"5d34984c8c0c4fdb3370501167f5758af5d65bf3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-setting 使用前须知：设置页只能在 Host 挂载该插件条目时提供；模型目录读取失败或配置不可写时，界面会显示相应状态，无法正常选择或保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:300-307","client/client.js:411-413","client/client.js:459-480"]}
